{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>9to5Mac 由 CleanMyMac by MacPaw 呈獻。隨住 macOS 27 Golden Gate 推出，先用 CleanMyMac 釋放空間、優化系統，確保你部新 Mac 由第一日起就全速運行。了解更多。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate 係對 macOS 26 Tahoe 嘅一次重大升級，唔單止係設計決策更聰明咁簡單。同一 iOS 27 for iPhone 一樣，Mac 加入咗 Liquid Glass 外觀滑桿，等你可以大幅改變成個系統嘅視覺效果。</p>\n<h2>滑桿</h2>\n<p>Liquid Glass 係 Apple 嘅設計語言，由 iOS 26 同 macOS 26 Tahoe 開始採用。最初 Liquid Glass 只有單一種外觀，Apple 之後加入咗一個設定令 Liquid Glass 冇咁通透。</p>\n<p>由 iOS 27 同 macOS 27 Golden Gate 開始，Liquid Glass 唔再局限於只有兩種風格。Apple 改為引入咗外觀滑桿，等你可以將 Liquid Glass 變得比以往更加通透，亦可以畀佢一個更朦朧但仍然現代嘅外觀。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate 預設採用中等設定。系統亦會喺初次設定時邀請你調整滑桿，之後亦可以喺「系統設定 &gt; 外觀」入面再作調整。</p>\n<p>Liquid Glass 滑桿會即時預覽每個設定嘅效果。三個刻度分別代表最通透、中等同最朦朧，但你亦可以將佢設定喺刻度之間嘅任何位置。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Ultraclear.webp?w=800\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Default.webp?w=800\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Fully-Tinted.webp?w=800\"/>\n<h2>Dock 欄</h2>\n<p>Dock 欄係會隨 Liquid Glass 滑桿設定而改變外觀嘅最顯眼元件。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Ultraclear.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Default.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Fully-Tinted.webp\"/>\n<p>佢嘅範圍可以由清晰顯示你嘅桌面背景圖片，到變成一種更朦朧同明確嘅材質。</p>\n<p>以下係近距離睇嘅效果：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Ultraclear.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Default.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Fully-Tinted.webp\"/>\n<h2>小工具</h2>\n<p>macOS 桌面小工具可以係全彩色、暗色，或者自動變色。Liquid Glass 滑桿亦會改變暗色小工具嘅外觀。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<h2>Apple Music 同 Podcast</h2>\n<p>Apple Music 同 Podcast 等具有系統「正在播放」欄嘅應用程式，會因應 Liquid Glass 滑桿嘅位置而呈現截然不同嘅外觀。</p>\n<p>例如 Podcast 嘅「正在播放」欄係咁嘅：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<p>而音樂嘅「正在播放」欄就係咁：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<h2>其他</h2>\n<p>滑桿亦會套用喺側邊欄、工具列同工具列按鈕上，改變「相片」、Safari 同其他具有視窗介面元素嘅應用程式外觀。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate Liquid Glass 滑桿嘅一點係，單一滑桿控制晒成個系統嘅 Liquid Glass 外觀。即係話你嘅 Dock 欄、小工具同視窗介面元素都會採用同一種風格。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-01.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-03.webp\"/>\n<p>你鍾意邊種？更加通透、更加朦朧，定係兩者之間？就個人嚟講，我真係好鍾意更朦朧嗰個選項喺我部 Mac 上成熟同漂亮嘅感覺。不過，將佢調校得更通透都幾好玩，我好高興 macOS 27 Golden Gate 畀大家自行揀選嘅權利。</p>\n<p>歡迎喺留言區分享你嘅睇法！</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/CMM-Body-Image-1.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T01:35:05.191188+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1212,"images":25,"source":"9to5Mac","fallback":"none"}}